---
name: Detect a SOC Prime attack chain
description: |
  Runs the High-Order Sigma rule for the Kimsuky campaign against OCSF
  events: one pipeline matches the stage rules, correlates the findings per
  host, and alerts when a host covers all stages with at most 30 minutes
  between two findings.
---

// Point this source at your OCSF export, or replace it with a streaming source.
from_file "/var/log/ocsf/events.ndjson" {
  read_ndjson
}
// Alert only on complete chains instead of 60% of the stages.
socprime::hos::detect "kimsuky_diplomats", threshold=1.0
socprime::enrich
// Replace this sink with your SIEM or another destination as needed.
to_file "/var/lib/tenzir/socprime/findings/kimsuky-{uuid}.ndjson" {
  write_ndjson
}
